@finalize
title: Finalise the cabinet allocation
subtitle: Unspent leverage becomes coalition goodwill.
choose-if: ministry_count >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A governing Lewica delegation must take at least one portfolio.
on-arrival: {!
Q.ministries_finalized = 1;
Q.ko_coalition_dissent -= Math.floor(Q.ministry_leverage / 2);
Q.ministry_leverage = 0;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica takes " + Q.ministry_count + " cabinet portfolios";
!}
go-to: poland_government_formation.governing_agreement if ministry_return_mode = "governing_agreement"; poland_government_formation.cabinet_program if ministry_return_mode != "governing_agreement"

@opposition_allocation
title: Confidence without ministries
new-page: true
on-arrival: ministries_finalized = 1

= No ministries

Lewica promised confidence and supply, not cabinet service. The coalition
allocates every portfolio without it.

- @poland_government_formation.cabinet_program: Continue to the exposé
